  "method": "First independent full-repository review of the corrected candidate. Verified the content and mode of every tracked file and the 938-path source digest, parsed Python and JSON, reproduced all 197 generated protocol files and validated 611 definitions, 351 distinct internal references and the matching source metadata. Checked the Git object and publication inventory, 11 immutable links and 874 historical evidence records. Reviewed gateway and core operation receipts, native and web consumers, process/socket ownership and lifecycle, mobile UI and IPC logic, deployment, build packaging, test selection and release checks. Verified the corrected schema consumers, snapshot normalisation, x64/arm64 durability fixture, developer and isolated-runner creation masks, and the unchanged synchronous witness assertions. Built the server and ran 12 focused macOS files (157 passed, two Linux-only cases skipped) and 18 native Linux cases under caller mask 0002, including both missing on macOS; 159 distinct case identities overall. Verified the stopped-snapshot Python test under 0002 and 0077. Inspected the four official CN MCP configurations and both renderer paths, pinned/latest registry entries and the independent public check on this source. Real authenticated MCP operations, paid inference, a handset and a production deployment were outside this audit.",
